ubem_link:CategoryProfile a sh:NodeShape ;
	rdfs:comment "Category-specific part of a dataset profile: what a modeler must know about one kind of UBEM data before using it. There is one profile class per UBEM workflow role. The classes refine the per-category metadata table of an earlier taxonomy of open UBEM data: its free-text fields became typed fields with closed value lists, its \"macroscopic\" and \"microscopic\" energy data share EnergyProfile and differ in energy_data_scale, and its \"comprehensive data lake\" is a Catalog of profiles rather than a category." ;
	sh:closed false ;
	sh:ignoredProperties _:c14n262 ;
	sh:property _:c14n284 , _:c14n329 ;
	sh:targetClass ubem_link:CategoryProfile .
